Package: shinycapabilities
Title: Capability-Oriented Workflow Canvas for Shiny
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Adrian", "Antico", email = "adrianantico@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: Adrian Antico [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Adrian Antico <adrianantico@gmail.com>
Description: An experimental capability-oriented workflow canvas for Shiny.
    JavaScript owns responsive graph interaction while R owns capability
    registration, validation, dependency planning, scheduling, execution,
    caching, staleness, cancellation, and artifact references. Host
    applications provide domain-specific capabilities.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/AdrianAntico/shinycapabilities
BugReports: https://github.com/AdrianAntico/shinycapabilities/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    callr,
    digest,
    htmltools,
    jsonlite,
    shiny
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
SystemRequirements: Node.js and npm (optional; required only to rebuild bundled
    browser assets)
